        <language>en</language>

        <item>
            <title>Quill 0.11.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 19:33:25 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <link>https://github.com/imtamiliniyan/quill/releases/tag/v0.11.2</link>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed spoken digit lists like "number one, number two, number three" not converting to "1 2 3" when there's no other content between them.</li>
                    <li>Added a quick light/dark toggle and a bug-report shortcut in the title bar, always reachable regardless of which tab is open.</li>
                    <li>Feedback now offers a "Copy Instead" fallback if your Mac doesn't open a mail app for the Send Feedback button.</li>
                    <li>Fixed ⌘C/⌘V not working in text fields throughout the app.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
