        <item>
            <title>Quill 0.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:25:43 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <link>https://github.com/imtamiliniyan/quill/releases/tag/v0.10.0</link>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed a real crash: Local AI (on-device rewriting) could crash Quill on Apple M5 Macs the moment a model tried to load. Verified fixed on real M5 hardware, not just in code.</li>
                    <li>Enhancement Engine no longer shows a cloud provider and Local AI as both "Active" at once — only whichever one Auto Cleanup is actually set to says "Active" now; the other says what it's really doing instead.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
